<Base title="Ripples — One useful interaction creates another"><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A network where the currency is usefulness</p><h1>One useful interaction <em>creates another.</em></h1><p class="lede">Ripples brings people, questions and ideas together around a simple premise: lead with what you can give, stay curious, and make the next interaction count.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/join">Join the Ripple</a><a class="text-link" href="/about">What is Ripples? <span>→</span></a></div></div><Network/></section><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">A different starting question</p><h2>What if we stopped asking people what they do?</h2><div><p>A job title can be useful context. It is rarely the most interesting thing about someone.</p><p>Ripples starts elsewhere: <strong>How can you help? What are you curious about? What could you use help with?</strong></p></div></section><section class="three"><a href="/people"><span>01</span><h3>People</h3><p>Discover people through what they know, what they are curious about and how they are willing to help.</p><b>Meet the network →</b></a><a href="/ideas"><span>02</span><h3>Ideas</h3><p>Better questions, useful disagreements and things worth learning, crediting and passing on.</p><b>Explore ideas →</b></a><a href="/podcast"><span>03</span><h3>Conversations</h3><p>The podcast explores how people think, what shaped them and what changed their mind.</p><b>About the podcast →</b></a></section><section class="question"><p class="eyebrow">Put your hand up</p><blockquote>“What can you genuinely help someone with?”</blockquote><p>You do not need a grand title or a polished pitch. You need something useful you are prepared to share.</p><a class="button light" href="/join">Tell us how you can help</a></section><section class="loop"><p class="eyebrow">How Ripples grows</p><h2>People create the network.<br/><em>Useful interactions move it.</em></h2><ol><li><span>01</span><b>Offer</b><p>Share what you can genuinely help with.</p></li><li><span>02</span><b>Connect</b><p>Find a question, person or idea worth your attention.</p></li><li><span>03</span><b>Pass it on</b><p>Let one useful interaction create the next.</p></li></ol></section><section class="philosophy"><p class="eyebrow">The foundation</p><div><h2>Help because you can.</h2><h2>Make the next interaction count.</h2><h2>Act with integrity.</h2><h2>Trust the ripples.</h2></div></section></Base>
